WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
The deSiGN wordmark over the green Omarchy maze.

00:02.000 --> 00:13.000
Welcome to omadesign. Browse 52 editable templates and adapt a layout to a new document size.

00:13.000 --> 00:43.000
Constructing the deSiGN wordmark with precise vector paths, alignment, spacing, blur and shadow.

00:43.000 --> 00:56.000
Ruler guides, precise movement, snapping and vector reshaping.

00:56.000 --> 01:10.000
Path operations, editable masks and the healing brush.

01:10.000 --> 01:24.000
Photo adjustments and editable motion presets on the timeline.

01:24.000 --> 01:32.000
The contextual shortcut HUD reveals tool and modifier hints.

01:32.000 --> 01:37.000
The finished deSiGN wordmark animates into place.
